042343             0265*   ; https://www.omnimaga.org/asm-language/(z80)-32-bit-by-16-bits-division-and-32-bit-square-root/msg406903/#msg406903
042343             0266*   ; This divides HLIX by BC
042343             0267*   ; The result is stored in HLIX, the remainder in DE
042343             0268*   ; BC is unmodified
