042366             0290*   
042366             0291*   ; https://discord.com/channels/1158535358624039014/1282290921815408681/1329274504022720512
042366             0292*   ; calc84maniac's 32-bit by 23-bit division routine
042366             0293*   ; This divides AUIX by UDE (maximum 23 bits)
042366             0294*   ; The result is stored in AUIX, the remainder in UHL
042366             0295*   ; UDE, C are unmodified
042366             0296*   ; B is 0
